   "source": [
    "### What step 5 changes, and when cleaning happens\n",
    "**Step 5 is inspection only.** The missing reports, car_check, and housing_missing are separate summaries or temporary inspection tables. No values in df_clean have been filled, removed, or corrected here. The car-age indicator currently exists only in car_check, not in our model inputs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Findings from the saved inspection:** 67 columns have missing data, 50 have at least 20% missing, and none is entirely missing. All 202,924 nonowners lack car age; only 5 of 104,587 owners lack it (approximately 0.00478%). The three inspected housing fields are all missing together in 150,185 applications. These findings support investigation and proposed decisions; they do not automatically justify deleting features.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Our next actions:**\n",
    "1. Sections 6-8 inspect categories, impossible ranges, and outliers so we can justify changes.\n",
    "2. Section 9 applies confirmed corrections, starting with flagging employment value 365243 and replacing it with missing. Record every applied rule in the decision log.\n",
    "3. Section 10 removes TARGET and SK_ID_CURR from model inputs (retaining outcomes and IDs separately) and splits training from validation.\n",
    "4. Section 13 decides whether to exclude any features using training-set evidence. A column is not unused merely because it has missing entries.\n",
    "5. Sections 15-18 define and apply missing-value filling, encoding, and any agreed scaling using training-fitted rules. Those are the steps that prepare complete numeric model inputs.\n",
    "\n",
    "For our first version we propose retaining useful partially observed features, using training medians for numeric gaps and an explicit Missing category for text. Any feature exclusions must be documented and applied consistently to validation and future inputs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Display adjustment:** the detailed car report uses five decimal places because two decimals incorrectly looks like zero for the five car owners with missing age. Run the car-report cell again after this edit. No CSV was changed.\n"
   ]
