    "## 7. Validate numeric ranges and date offsets\n",
    "Check relevant financial amounts for nonpositive values and interpret results separately for each column. Zero may be valid in some financial fields. Estimate age from -DAYS_BIRTH / 365.25 for review and inspect the observed range.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Practice:** count suspicious values, display example records, and document which are confirmed invalid versus still under investigation. Choose age plausibility rules explicitly rather than silently deleting unusual applicants.\n",
    "\n",
    "Review DAYS_EMPLOYED=365243 as the known placeholder candidate. Negative birth and employment offsets are not inherently invalid.\n"
   ]
