    "## 14. Separate numeric and text features\n",
    "\n",
    "Create lists for the two preprocessing branches. Normalize actual text missing values to np.nan so the scikit-learn imputer can read them consistently. This does not guess categories or fit statistics. XNA and Unknown stay recorded labels.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
